WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.425 --> 01:38.945
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

02:22.145 --> 02:25.185
SNOW FALLS WITH YOU BESIDE ME

02:35.865 --> 02:37.865
LUAN NIAN

02:43.305 --> 02:44.145
Open the door.

03:05.345 --> 03:07.025
We're going to the hospital.

03:13.105 --> 03:14.185
I'm not going.

03:33.625 --> 03:36.025
Your face is burning red,
and you won't go to the hospital?

03:36.105 --> 03:37.185
Do you have a death wish?

04:16.225 --> 04:17.745
I really don't need to go to the hospital.

04:18.705 --> 04:20.345
I'll be fine after some rest.

04:22.985 --> 04:23.825
Fine.

04:24.345 --> 04:26.785
I'll check the company system
for your emergency contact

04:27.345 --> 04:29.465
and inform your family.

04:29.545 --> 04:32.425
If you suffer any complications
or accidents later,

04:32.505 --> 04:33.345
the company won't be liable.

04:47.505 --> 04:48.705
Your hand's burning.

05:08.785 --> 05:11.025
Stop being stubborn. Let's go.

05:42.425 --> 05:45.145
The doctor said it was a mild case
of mycoplasma pneumonia.

05:45.745 --> 05:47.705
A cough and a slight fever.

05:49.265 --> 05:50.665
Some congee should be fine, right?

05:52.625 --> 05:54.625
It's not me. I'm asking for a friend.

05:56.025 --> 05:56.945
Thanks.

05:58.345 --> 05:59.865
Thank you, Dr. Liang.

07:06.185 --> 07:07.065
You're awake.

07:08.505 --> 07:09.345
Come eat.

07:26.385 --> 07:27.705
Thank you, Mr. Luan.

07:30.625 --> 07:31.505
Drop the formalities.

07:32.425 --> 07:34.665
Don't you get tired
of addressing me like that?

07:36.585 --> 07:37.465
I…

07:47.905 --> 07:49.145
Did you burn your hand?

07:49.905 --> 07:50.785
Did you put anything on it?

07:51.785 --> 07:54.305
Don't worry about it. Eat.

07:58.625 --> 07:59.945
I'm feeling much better.

08:00.745 --> 08:02.385
Could you take me home?

08:03.225 --> 08:04.385
I don't want to impose.

08:06.105 --> 08:07.025
Why are you acting like a stranger?

08:14.665 --> 08:16.225
We dated, after all.

08:16.305 --> 08:18.745
You don't need to feel bad
about letting me take care of you.

08:24.865 --> 08:25.985
I want to go home.

08:27.945 --> 08:28.785
I want…

08:33.985 --> 08:35.545
to end this relationship.

08:41.225 --> 08:42.105
We can.

08:46.225 --> 08:47.225
Once you're better.

09:00.625 --> 09:03.745
Later, when I looked back
on who I was then,

09:04.745 --> 09:09.345
I couldn't explain
why I made that decision.

09:11.385 --> 09:15.185
Why do people always do
such foolish things

09:15.265 --> 09:16.665
when they're young?

09:20.665 --> 09:24.705
How could something
that began like that ever end well?

09:26.265 --> 09:30.745
I acted as if foolish choices
came without a price.

09:42.665 --> 09:43.825
You sweated from the fever.

09:43.905 --> 09:45.145
Go take a shower.

09:45.945 --> 09:48.465
You need proper rest to recover.

09:54.905 --> 09:55.905
Come on.

10:08.705 --> 10:11.065
Did you prepare all this for me?

10:13.785 --> 10:14.785
Other women left them here.

10:16.265 --> 10:17.865
Label them when you use them.

10:18.385 --> 10:20.945
That way, the next woman who comes over

10:21.985 --> 10:23.585
won't use or wear the wrong things.

10:26.185 --> 10:27.745
These match my prescription.

10:29.185 --> 10:30.265
What a coincidence.

10:59.225 --> 11:00.105
Come sit down.

11:15.505 --> 11:16.625
What are you covering up?

11:17.185 --> 11:18.225
I've seen it all before.

11:22.905 --> 11:25.425
Why are you always so cutting?

11:27.145 --> 11:29.425
Are you like this with everyone
or only with me?

11:49.385 --> 11:53.705
You only said you wanted to end things
because you were angry, right?

11:57.665 --> 11:58.905
I meant it.

12:05.585 --> 12:06.425
Really?

12:38.545 --> 12:39.625
It's snowing.

13:07.745 --> 13:08.625
Let's go watch it.

13:34.065 --> 13:34.905
It's cold.

13:37.465 --> 13:38.345
Don't end this.

13:39.065 --> 13:40.665
Or we'll freeze
into ice sculptures together.

13:50.185 --> 13:51.625
Could you be more childish?

13:51.705 --> 13:52.825
I'm still sick.

13:55.785 --> 13:57.225
Then don't break up with me.

14:28.305 --> 14:31.385
There were so many gift boxes
in your trunk.

14:32.545 --> 14:34.545
Were they meant for other women?

14:40.905 --> 14:41.945
Shang Zhitao,

14:42.905 --> 14:46.305
do you know how
luxury-brand pre-spend works?

14:55.705 --> 14:58.745
I don't want to know anything,
including you.

15:06.185 --> 15:08.865
You can take your time getting
to know me once you're better.

15:25.705 --> 15:26.825
SHAANXI GUOKUI BUNS

15:26.905 --> 15:27.745
Mom.

15:29.145 --> 15:30.625
Did you get the buns?

15:30.705 --> 15:32.785
I did. They're delicious.

15:33.505 --> 15:35.585
We don't have much worth sending.

15:36.105 --> 15:37.345
But I know you like them,

15:37.425 --> 15:40.905
so I sent extra for you
to share with your roommates.

15:40.985 --> 15:42.185
Is it enough?

15:42.265 --> 15:44.625
Yes. Don't worry.

15:44.705 --> 15:46.025
About the house,

15:46.985 --> 15:48.465
your father still thinks we should buy it.

15:50.025 --> 15:51.905
Your sister's grown up.

15:51.985 --> 15:53.425
It really isn't convenient.

15:54.465 --> 15:57.025
Mom, what about the money
I just sent home?

15:57.825 --> 15:59.025
Did Dad take it again?

15:59.105 --> 16:01.265
Give me the phone. I'll talk to him.

16:02.545 --> 16:05.265
Listen. That place has a lot of buyers,

16:05.345 --> 16:06.425
and it's a bargain.

16:06.505 --> 16:08.905
We won't get another chance like this.

16:08.985 --> 16:10.825
I'm still 30,000 yuan short.
Send it over right away.

16:10.905 --> 16:13.025
Don't talk to him like that.

16:13.105 --> 16:15.825
I know life in Beijing isn't easy for you,

16:16.905 --> 16:18.945
but we want to buy a bigger place

16:19.025 --> 16:20.905
and put it
in your and your sister's names.

16:20.985 --> 16:23.185
That way, you'll both
have something to fall back on.

16:23.265 --> 16:24.785
Don't bother explaining.

16:24.865 --> 16:26.025
Tell him to send the money now.

16:26.105 --> 16:27.545
Hang up and go cook.

16:42.025 --> 16:45.545
TRANSFER: RMB 30,000

16:49.585 --> 16:51.705
TRANSFER SUCCESSFUL

17:09.505 --> 17:11.665
What? Pneumonia?

17:11.745 --> 17:12.944
Are you OK?

17:13.025 --> 17:15.184
Yes. I'm almost recovered.

17:15.265 --> 17:18.345
So you're staying at Luan Nian's now?

17:19.745 --> 17:20.865
Are you two back together?

17:20.944 --> 17:22.424
I'VE GONE TO THE SUPERMARKET
I'LL BE BACK SOON

17:26.265 --> 17:27.825
He's been taking good care of me.

17:28.345 --> 17:29.785
He's done everything he can.

17:30.905 --> 17:33.425
He rushed back
to take care of you, his girlfriend.

17:33.985 --> 17:35.985
He is into you.

17:37.305 --> 17:39.985
I can't bring myself to ask
about him and Zang Yao.

17:43.865 --> 17:44.945
I'll leave it at that.

17:45.665 --> 17:47.225
I don't want to dig any deeper.

17:49.705 --> 17:50.825
Take your time.

17:51.705 --> 17:54.465
Some things can't be rushed.

17:54.545 --> 17:59.425
Leaving some questions unasked may
make a relationship last longer, right?

18:00.865 --> 18:01.825
You're right.

18:05.025 --> 18:07.785
I have to go. I think he's back.

18:48.465 --> 18:50.025
Your friend's here.

18:51.625 --> 18:53.145
Why are you here?

18:59.585 --> 19:00.985
Drinking in broad daylight?

19:01.065 --> 19:04.225
Why can't I? I drink when I feel like it.

19:05.905 --> 19:06.905
Want some?

19:07.945 --> 19:08.785
I…

19:09.465 --> 19:11.625
-I should go home.
-Why?

19:16.025 --> 19:16.905
Are you fully recovered?

19:20.785 --> 19:21.905
I'll make you some soup later.

19:23.705 --> 19:26.105
It'd be awkward with me here.

19:29.785 --> 19:30.905
She's the one who's intruding.

19:37.505 --> 19:39.145
So she's your new girlfriend?

19:40.825 --> 19:42.025
-Yes.
-No.

19:47.585 --> 19:50.065
You two really aren't on the same page.

19:53.865 --> 19:56.025
Maybe you should change
the water in the tank.

19:56.625 --> 19:57.625
Why?

19:58.865 --> 20:00.105
She threw up in it.

20:02.145 --> 20:03.465
Zang Yao.

20:16.105 --> 20:17.905
Shang Zhitao.

20:17.985 --> 20:19.505
That's a pretty name.

20:24.385 --> 20:25.625
How do you put up with Luan Nian?

20:25.705 --> 20:26.945
Look at him.

20:27.025 --> 20:30.225
Even at home, he looks like
he's chairing a board meeting.

20:32.625 --> 20:35.305
What kind of rare fish
is it that you treasure so much?

20:35.385 --> 20:37.825
If it dies, I'll buy you ten more.

20:38.985 --> 20:41.425
If you can't make conversation, say less.

20:42.345 --> 20:43.985
Hongqi is his baby.

20:44.065 --> 20:45.705
Sometimes he talks to it.

20:47.305 --> 20:48.145
What are you talking about?

20:48.785 --> 20:52.345
I heard you. You told it to swim faster.

20:56.505 --> 20:58.185
We've known each other for over 20 years.

20:58.265 --> 21:01.145
He's always been quiet
and never liked talking much.

21:01.225 --> 21:03.145
So he's been confiding in his fish.

21:03.225 --> 21:06.465
I've been away so long
that I understand you less and less.

21:09.305 --> 21:10.385
How about this?

21:10.465 --> 21:14.065
Let's play a game we used to play as kids.

21:14.145 --> 21:16.105
Rock-paper-scissors, then questions.

21:16.185 --> 21:18.625
Whoever loses can either answer a question

21:18.705 --> 21:19.985
or take a flick to the forehead.

21:21.265 --> 21:22.385
You know how to play, right?

21:23.865 --> 21:26.145
Come on. Rock, paper, scissors.

21:30.985 --> 21:31.825
You first.

21:32.505 --> 21:33.785
Why did you suddenly come back to China?

21:33.865 --> 21:36.785
I broke up with my British boyfriend.

21:36.865 --> 21:39.185
Then I met a guy from Guangzhou
and followed him there.

21:39.785 --> 21:40.865
You certainly kept busy.

21:42.465 --> 21:45.425
Will you take a flick to the forehead
or answer a question?

21:46.465 --> 21:47.465
I'll answer a question.

21:50.425 --> 21:51.825
Is anyone pursuing you right now?

21:54.465 --> 21:55.305
No.

21:57.745 --> 21:59.185
That's normal. Nothing to be ashamed of.

22:00.305 --> 22:04.425
Some people go their whole lives
without anyone ever pursuing them.

22:08.825 --> 22:10.145
I have been pursued.

22:11.305 --> 22:12.745
My ex-boyfriend loved me very much.

22:12.825 --> 22:14.625
Then why did he break up with you?

22:17.505 --> 22:19.665
-Again.
-Come on.

22:20.265 --> 22:21.425
Rock, paper, scissors.

22:23.185 --> 22:24.025
You again.

22:26.065 --> 22:27.105
Still answering a question?

22:29.025 --> 22:29.825
I'll take the flick.

22:29.905 --> 22:31.625
-Are you sure?
-Yes.

22:40.505 --> 22:41.345
Come here.

22:46.705 --> 22:48.425
What's wrong? You chose the flick.

22:49.025 --> 22:51.025
I didn't think you'd flick me that hard.

22:52.345 --> 22:54.065
When we were kids,
Luan Nian could flick my forehead

22:54.145 --> 22:55.905
hard enough to send an eraser flying.

22:55.985 --> 22:57.825
He never went easy on girls.

22:59.265 --> 23:01.065
I thought you'd go easier on me.

23:02.545 --> 23:03.505
Let me see.

23:04.785 --> 23:05.705
I'm fine.

23:07.345 --> 23:08.225
There, there.

23:10.065 --> 23:11.825
Again. Come on.

23:12.465 --> 23:13.905
Rock, paper, scissors.

23:20.145 --> 23:21.945
You know Luan Nian

23:22.025 --> 23:23.905
has a crescent-shaped scar
on his left leg, right?

23:25.665 --> 23:26.705
He…

23:27.265 --> 23:28.345
He does?

23:28.865 --> 23:31.065
-Do you know how he got it?
-From running.

23:32.105 --> 23:33.105
Nonsense.

23:33.185 --> 23:35.465
When I was seven, I took you
climbing a wall to raid a bird's nest.

23:35.545 --> 23:36.745
Zang Yao.

23:37.385 --> 23:39.905
Fine. I'll talk about something else.

23:39.985 --> 23:40.825
His mom said

23:40.905 --> 23:44.025
that by the time he was seven or eight,
he already acted like a grown-up,

23:44.105 --> 23:45.145
always frowning,

23:45.865 --> 23:48.385
never truly interested in anything,
and impossible to please.

23:48.985 --> 23:53.025
You're nothing like Dr. Liang
or your father.

23:53.105 --> 23:54.745
Were you adopted?

24:00.665 --> 24:01.665
How about another round?

24:03.105 --> 24:04.265
Sure.

24:04.345 --> 24:05.905
Rock, paper, scissors.

24:08.105 --> 24:08.945
Forehead flick.

24:27.145 --> 24:27.985
That was gentle.

24:39.345 --> 24:40.945
When are you two getting married?

24:42.025 --> 24:43.225
We don't have any plans yet.

24:45.265 --> 24:46.385
I'm warning you.

24:46.465 --> 24:48.025
Don't say anything to my mom.

24:49.425 --> 24:52.385
I was asking on Dr. Liang's behalf.

24:52.465 --> 24:54.265
Really. She's always asking me
to set you up with someone.

24:54.945 --> 24:56.065
She says with your personality,

24:56.145 --> 24:57.585
you'll bottle everything up
until it kills you.

25:12.465 --> 25:13.545
Boring.

25:16.865 --> 25:20.425
Well, I hope you two make it all the way.

25:33.025 --> 25:34.985
I'm meeting my girls at the bar. Bye.

26:05.505 --> 26:07.185
I only wanted us to be family

26:08.505 --> 26:09.665
and best friends.

26:58.785 --> 26:59.745
Take your medicine.

27:08.665 --> 27:11.545
When your ex flicked you on the forehead,
was he gentler than I was?

27:20.705 --> 27:22.705
I don't know you as well as Zang Yao does,

27:22.785 --> 27:24.705
and we don't share as many memories.

27:24.785 --> 27:27.265
Let me see the scar she mentioned.

27:27.345 --> 27:28.225
Shang Zhitao.

27:59.625 --> 28:00.705
Was Mount Tai fun?

28:04.105 --> 28:05.305
Yes.

28:06.385 --> 28:07.505
More fun than being with me?

28:22.305 --> 28:23.865
Do you hold a grudge over everything?

28:24.465 --> 28:25.745
I went with my roommates.

28:25.825 --> 28:27.945
We're very close,

28:28.025 --> 28:31.905
so we often do things together as a group.

28:35.585 --> 28:38.465
Are group outings more fun
than being with me?

28:39.065 --> 28:40.705
Are you fun?

28:41.825 --> 28:42.665
No.

28:43.345 --> 28:44.865
I'm not cheerful.

28:44.945 --> 28:48.825
I have no empathy and no soft side.

28:49.425 --> 28:51.385
At least you know yourself.

28:56.865 --> 28:57.865
You do have a soft side.

28:58.705 --> 29:00.185
You have friends,

29:00.785 --> 29:02.945
people you travel with,

29:03.025 --> 29:06.425
and even a childhood sweetheart.

29:06.505 --> 29:07.545
Isn't that right?

29:11.905 --> 29:12.745
Come.

29:21.425 --> 29:22.785
Zang Yao is a few years younger than me.

29:23.785 --> 29:25.185
She was sickly as a child,

29:25.265 --> 29:27.025
and my mom often
wrote prescriptions for her.

29:28.585 --> 29:29.905
Later, my parents went abroad.

29:31.065 --> 29:34.665
Her mom was a great cook,
so I often ate at their place.

29:36.425 --> 29:39.985
Your parents went abroad
without taking you?

29:41.625 --> 29:43.145
They went abroad for business.

29:43.745 --> 29:44.585
I didn't want to go.

29:44.665 --> 29:46.505
Are they back now?

29:48.265 --> 29:49.705
But we rarely get to see each other.

29:50.545 --> 29:51.745
Not even during Chinese New Year?

29:51.825 --> 29:53.705
It's almost here.

29:54.305 --> 29:56.585
Once the holiday starts,
I'm going back home.

29:59.145 --> 30:00.065
Shang Zhitao.

30:01.585 --> 30:03.065
When we see each other next year,

30:03.665 --> 30:05.785
I hope you'll call me something different.

30:08.345 --> 30:12.105
What do you want me to call you?

30:14.585 --> 30:15.945
Just call me Luan Nian.

30:20.945 --> 30:22.105
Luan…

30:24.265 --> 30:25.105
Luan Nian.

30:29.745 --> 30:30.665
Luan Nian.

30:33.865 --> 30:34.945
Don't tempt me.

30:36.625 --> 30:37.465
You're still sick.

30:50.905 --> 30:52.225
Actually,

30:53.345 --> 30:56.745
I think it's nice
just lying here like this,

30:58.865 --> 30:59.865
without doing anything.

31:04.665 --> 31:05.505
What's nice about it?

31:39.425 --> 31:40.385
TO-DO LIST
1. LEARN TO DRIVE 2. IMPROVE MY ENGLISH

31:40.465 --> 31:41.345
3. MAKE AT LEAST THREE FRIENDS
4. PASS PROBATION AND GET PROMOTED TO SAE

31:48.225 --> 31:50.945
5. CAREER GOAL: ACCOUNT MANAGER

31:52.985 --> 31:54.665
Did you get your year-end bonus?

31:55.745 --> 31:56.785
Check your email.

32:01.465 --> 32:02.705
That's so much money!

32:02.785 --> 32:04.585
The more, the better.

32:04.665 --> 32:05.705
Get a grip, silly.

32:06.545 --> 32:09.665
HR just announced
a company retreat in Phuket.

32:10.745 --> 32:12.265
Phuket?

32:15.585 --> 32:17.025
-Here.
-No, I can't.

32:17.105 --> 32:19.505
Just take it. Once your mentor,
always your mentor.

32:20.505 --> 32:21.345
Happy Chinese New Year.

32:33.105 --> 32:34.465
I'm grateful to Lime

32:36.665 --> 32:39.185
and to myself for working so hard.

32:39.265 --> 32:40.105
GOOD LUCK ALWAYS

32:40.185 --> 32:42.785
My job gave me the chance to work
at the forefront of the industry

32:43.385 --> 32:45.945
and see my efforts rewarded.

32:47.865 --> 32:48.745
I'm also grateful to Luan Nian.

32:50.225 --> 32:51.705
Thank you for your kindness,

32:52.345 --> 32:53.865
for always being strict,

32:53.945 --> 32:57.025
and for pushing me
to grow in my own way.

33:03.905 --> 33:06.625
JANUARY 2014, HARBIN

33:08.625 --> 33:10.225
I LOVE HARBIN

33:14.585 --> 33:15.625
CENTRAL AVENUE

33:15.705 --> 33:16.985
OLD COUPLE'S TAVERN

33:17.065 --> 33:19.265
Dad, I'll have a drink with you tonight.

33:20.025 --> 33:21.505
I'll join in too.

33:21.585 --> 33:22.825
You can barely hold your liquor.

33:22.905 --> 33:23.825
Just have a sip.

33:24.785 --> 33:25.905
-Cheers.
-Happy Chinese New Year!

33:25.985 --> 33:27.785
-Happy Chinese New Year!
-Happy Chinese New Year.

33:28.665 --> 33:30.185
Easy on the drinks.

33:30.265 --> 33:31.305
That's strong.

33:31.945 --> 33:35.305
Sweetheart, try the soup I made for you.

33:35.385 --> 33:36.585
It's been simmering all afternoon.

33:36.665 --> 33:38.305
It smells amazing.

33:38.825 --> 33:40.465
Here. Try it.

33:40.545 --> 33:42.025
All right.

33:42.105 --> 33:43.945
-You have some too.
-OK.

33:44.025 --> 33:45.865
Since when did you become
such a great cook?

33:45.945 --> 33:46.785
See?

33:46.865 --> 33:49.505
If Michelin knew,
they'd be giving you a star.

33:51.145 --> 33:55.465
Your auntie next door has a nephew
who's a programmer in Beijing.

33:55.545 --> 33:58.265
His hair is really thick.

33:58.345 --> 34:02.065
And his face is chiseled

34:02.145 --> 34:04.145
-like a European statue.
-Mom…

34:04.225 --> 34:05.105
Give it a rest.

34:05.185 --> 34:06.985
A European statue?

34:07.065 --> 34:09.705
Exactly. Besides, I want to focus on work.

34:09.784 --> 34:11.465
I'm not looking to date right now.

34:11.545 --> 34:13.625
-All right, let me name the dishes.
-Look at you…

34:13.705 --> 34:16.905
We've got Disanxian, sweet-and-sour pork,

34:16.985 --> 34:20.865
and your favorite, blood sausage!

34:20.945 --> 34:22.824
-Dig in.
-Eat.

34:27.105 --> 34:28.744
The Spring Festival
is always livelier at home.

34:28.824 --> 34:30.145
Everything feels so festive.

34:30.225 --> 34:32.065
-Stop watching and eat.
-Come on.

34:34.385 --> 34:35.425
Eat.

34:35.505 --> 34:36.705
LUAN NIAN, HAPPY CHINESE NEW YEAR
WISHING YOU ALL THE BEST THIS YEAR

34:36.784 --> 34:37.985
It smells amazing.

34:38.065 --> 34:39.225
Dig in, sweetheart.

34:39.304 --> 34:40.344
Have some blood sausage.

34:41.705 --> 34:43.185
Just looking at you makes me happy.

34:48.145 --> 34:49.505
Mom, this is so good.

34:49.585 --> 34:50.425
Try some.

34:56.465 --> 34:58.785
Luan Nian, Happy Chinese New Year.

34:59.465 --> 35:01.785
Wishing you all the best this year.

35:10.785 --> 35:13.305
Aren't you hot

35:13.385 --> 35:15.665
-wearing a turtleneck indoors?
-No.

35:16.585 --> 35:17.905
Here, have some fruit.

35:18.545 --> 35:19.385
Here.

35:23.185 --> 35:25.825
Are you hiding something from me?

35:26.465 --> 35:28.785
-Like what?
-Like what?

35:29.585 --> 35:31.025
Don't walk away.

35:31.105 --> 35:32.505
I'm asking you.

35:32.585 --> 35:33.465
Go ahead.

35:34.305 --> 35:37.545
Are you seeing someone?

35:38.785 --> 35:40.425
Are you really that eager for me to date,

35:40.505 --> 35:42.705
get married, and give you a granddaughter?

35:43.385 --> 35:44.705
Why not a grandson?

35:46.025 --> 35:47.025
I prefer a girl.

35:47.105 --> 35:49.385
Of course, a granddaughter
would be better.

35:49.465 --> 35:50.385
I'd love that.

35:51.305 --> 35:53.385
Don't change the subject.
Are you seeing someone?

35:55.545 --> 35:56.785
I am.

35:57.385 --> 35:58.465
Really?

35:58.545 --> 36:00.905
What does she do?

36:00.985 --> 36:02.385
What's her personality like?

36:03.105 --> 36:04.065
What does she look like?

36:04.145 --> 36:07.065
She's easy on the eyes,
has a great personality,

36:07.145 --> 36:08.065
and works a regular office job.

36:08.665 --> 36:10.905
What kind of compliment
is "easy on the eyes"?

36:11.665 --> 36:14.105
It means she's pleasant to look at.

36:16.305 --> 36:18.385
Someone steady with a regular job is good.

36:19.145 --> 36:20.905
Don't date someone too domineering.

36:21.705 --> 36:22.785
We don't need that in this family.

36:24.505 --> 36:27.705
I'm choosing a girlfriend,
not a daughter-in-law for you.

36:28.305 --> 36:29.465
With your temper,

36:30.665 --> 36:31.625
you'll break up anyway.

36:32.705 --> 36:35.305
With your temper,
Mom still hasn't left you.

36:38.705 --> 36:40.145
All right, enough.

36:40.225 --> 36:41.425
This is good.

36:41.505 --> 36:44.345
I thought you'd be alone forever.

36:46.185 --> 36:48.385
A good personality matters.

36:49.025 --> 36:52.185
A girl may date you at first
because of your looks,

36:52.265 --> 36:56.425
but sooner or later,
she might not be able to stand you.

37:00.145 --> 37:03.225
By the way, Song Qiuhan's father told me

37:03.745 --> 37:06.065
your company was trying
to land Xingchi Auto as a client.

37:07.585 --> 37:08.665
We're working on it.

37:08.745 --> 37:10.185
How far along are you?

37:10.265 --> 37:14.145
In a deal of this size,
a proposal can only take you so far.

37:14.665 --> 37:15.665
People are what make deals happen.

37:16.945 --> 37:18.505
I know how to manage client relationships.

37:18.585 --> 37:20.265
Don't trouble yourself with it, Mr. Luan.

37:23.105 --> 37:24.905
Don't let your talent make you arrogant.

37:25.585 --> 37:28.265
Creative ideas
aren't as valuable as you think.

37:28.345 --> 37:31.225
You need to spend more time
and put in more effort

37:31.305 --> 37:34.425
to understand what the client truly wants.

37:35.105 --> 37:35.985
Only then can you be sure of success.

37:36.065 --> 37:38.865
Why haven't you put this much effort
into Mom and me?

37:38.945 --> 37:40.785
Your own family
has never enjoyed that privilege.

37:41.385 --> 37:42.665
What nonsense are you talking about?

37:43.265 --> 37:44.825
I'm teaching you how to deal with people.

37:45.985 --> 37:48.505
If I hadn't been so strict
with you growing up

37:49.025 --> 37:50.225
and pushed you to become capable,

37:50.305 --> 37:51.905
would you be where you are today?

37:53.345 --> 37:55.025
Cacti can grow in the desert,

37:55.105 --> 37:57.905
but that doesn't mean
the desert is good for plants.

37:57.985 --> 37:59.905
-Hey you…
-All right, enough.

37:59.985 --> 38:00.825
Enough.

38:00.905 --> 38:03.025
It's Chinese New Year.
Why bring that up now?

38:03.105 --> 38:04.665
Our son is already doing very well.

38:04.745 --> 38:06.185
He doesn't need your guidance.

38:09.025 --> 38:10.065
Ignore him.

38:11.105 --> 38:12.665
Where are you going?

38:12.745 --> 38:14.785
Send me a photo of the girl.

38:14.865 --> 38:15.985
OK, I'll send you one.

38:16.065 --> 38:16.905
Hurry.

38:22.425 --> 38:23.425
Here it is.

38:26.945 --> 38:28.825
Look at what he sent me.

38:28.905 --> 38:30.345
Isn't that you?

38:30.425 --> 38:31.745
If he'd really wanted you to know,

38:32.425 --> 38:34.225
he would've sent you her photo long ago.

38:34.865 --> 38:37.105
You're always sticking
your nose into things.

38:37.185 --> 38:38.385
Can't I ask about my own son's

38:38.465 --> 38:39.905
-love life?
-What good does that do?

38:41.545 --> 38:43.385
He keeps brushing us off.

38:44.545 --> 38:47.705
You know perfectly well
he hates being interfered with

38:47.785 --> 38:49.865
and tied down, yet you still lecture him.

38:49.945 --> 38:51.905
Why can't I lecture him?

38:53.105 --> 38:56.345
He's been giving people
the silent treatment since childhood.

38:57.145 --> 38:58.185
What does he know about love?

38:58.265 --> 38:59.865
He knows nothing about it.

39:01.505 --> 39:05.905
I've also heard
he can be arrogant with clients

39:05.985 --> 39:06.825
and incredibly difficult to deal with.

39:07.425 --> 39:08.585
Who would like someone like that?

39:09.185 --> 39:11.305
People don't like him,
and he doesn't like people.

39:11.385 --> 39:12.465
Isn't that just perfect?

39:12.545 --> 39:13.665
Perfect?

39:15.425 --> 39:16.265
You've spoiled him.

39:16.345 --> 39:18.185
Why are you so annoying?

39:18.265 --> 39:20.025
Our son is right.

39:20.105 --> 39:22.425
You should date someone
you enjoy looking at.

39:52.825 --> 39:54.585
Go easier on my neck next time.

39:58.225 --> 40:00.025
LUAN NIAN

40:07.305 --> 40:09.185
Why is it so quiet over there?

40:09.825 --> 40:12.345
The firecrackers have
already started here.

40:12.945 --> 40:14.425
My place is well soundproofed.

40:16.025 --> 40:17.225
What did you say?

40:17.945 --> 40:19.145
-Hello?
-Hello?

40:19.225 --> 40:21.545
-Sweetheart, come set off fireworks!
-Coming!

40:21.625 --> 40:24.425
I have to go. Bye.

40:34.545 --> 40:35.985
Happy Chinese New Year!

40:36.785 --> 40:39.265
Happy Chinese New Year!

40:39.345 --> 40:40.865
Happy Chinese New Year!

40:44.865 --> 40:46.305
They're beautiful.

40:48.305 --> 40:49.785
So beautiful!

40:52.185 --> 40:53.665
Happy Chinese New Year!

40:54.265 --> 40:55.105
Your red envelope.

40:57.225 --> 40:59.385
Come on. Family photo.

41:15.345 --> 41:16.545
Come back to Beijing soon.

41:58.545 --> 41:59.985
BOARDING GATES

42:04.265 --> 42:05.625
You've got to hand it to Luke.

42:05.705 --> 42:07.545
He picked Phuket for the company retreat.

42:07.625 --> 42:08.625
Yeah.

42:11.385 --> 42:12.345
Lumi.

42:13.705 --> 42:15.665
Why aren't you wearing
the dress I bought you?

42:15.745 --> 42:17.065
You're not wearing yours either.

42:17.145 --> 42:18.185
Mine's in my suitcase.

42:18.265 --> 42:19.145
So is mine.

42:19.225 --> 42:20.065
Alright.

42:20.145 --> 42:21.505
Then we'll change when we get there.

42:21.585 --> 42:22.425
Sit here.

42:23.145 --> 42:24.225
Where's your seat?

42:24.305 --> 42:25.505
-My seat…
-Look.

42:26.745 --> 42:27.785
Isn't that Luke?

42:29.465 --> 42:31.945
He's not joining us
on this southern tour, is he?

42:32.025 --> 42:34.185
Wouldn't that mean overtime in Phuket?

42:34.265 --> 42:35.425
No way.

42:35.505 --> 42:37.905
Why would he come on our company retreat?

42:37.985 --> 42:41.145
Probably because I'm the boss,
and I can go wherever I want.

42:44.545 --> 42:45.825
Where are you going?

42:47.025 --> 42:48.225
On the company retreat.

42:49.105 --> 42:50.185
You're coming with us?

42:50.265 --> 42:51.705
Is there a problem?

42:56.825 --> 42:57.865
Then…

42:58.425 --> 42:59.945
why aren't you in the first-class lounge?

43:00.025 --> 43:02.905
Since this is a company retreat,
there'll be no special treatment.

43:06.105 --> 43:06.945
Can I sit here?

43:08.265 --> 43:09.465
Let's move it.

43:10.785 --> 43:11.625
Go ahead.

43:18.345 --> 43:20.625
Could you be any more inconsiderate?

43:21.345 --> 43:23.585
How are we supposed
to have fun with you there?

43:24.865 --> 43:26.345
Then don't go.

43:38.065 --> 43:39.185
Why do you keep looking at me?

43:40.185 --> 43:42.145
It's not like I refused to get you
a business-class seat.

43:45.545 --> 43:47.265
I'll upgrade you now.

43:49.465 --> 43:51.665
Come on. Help me see
if we can upgrade his seat.

43:55.665 --> 43:58.065
Passengers traveling to Phuket,

43:58.145 --> 44:01.465
please gather your belongings
and prepare to board.

44:27.505 --> 44:28.345
You're awake?

44:30.785 --> 44:33.065
Here. Have some water.

44:49.465 --> 44:50.305
Your fever's gone down.

44:50.825 --> 44:52.785
If it comes back tomorrow,

44:53.305 --> 44:54.185
you'll still need a shot
to bring the fever down.

44:56.665 --> 44:58.345
Ask Alex for leave.

44:58.985 --> 45:00.345
Take five full days off.

45:02.665 --> 45:03.945
I don't need that many days.

45:06.665 --> 45:07.705
I still have work to do.

45:07.785 --> 45:10.705
Once the fever fries your brain,
you won't have to work at all.

45:14.665 --> 45:15.985
I'll rest at home.

45:32.145 --> 45:33.545
I know you have something to say.

45:34.745 --> 45:35.585
I'm going out for a while.

45:35.665 --> 45:38.665
Think about how you want to say it
before I get back.
